#### importLineFor
import os
import geo/shapes
import @geo/circle
import "github.com/user/lib"
import "github.com/user/lib/pkg/file"
#### a std import goes into the std group
before the first that sorts after it: @14-14 package main\n\nimport json\nimport os\nimport strings\n\nimport geo\n\nmethod main() {\n}\n
between two: @24-24 package main\n\nimport os\nimport path\nimport strings\n\nimport geo\n\nmethod main() {\n}\n
after the last of the group: @38-38 package main\n\nimport os\nimport strings\nimport thread\n\nimport geo\n\nmethod main() {\n}\n
already imported: no edit
a project import is not a std import: no edit
#### a project import goes into the project group
in the middle: @36-36 package main\n\nimport os\n\nimport geo\nimport other\nimport util\n\nmethod main() {\n}\n
before the first: @25-25 package main\n\nimport os\n\nimport alpha\nimport geo\nimport util\n\nmethod main() {\n}\n
after the last: @47-47 package main\n\nimport os\n\nimport geo\nimport util\nimport zeta\n\nmethod main() {\n}\n
a file import sorts before the folders: @25-25 package main\n\nimport os\n\nimport @helper\nimport geo\nimport util\n\nmethod main() {\n}\n
a dependency import sorts before the files: @25-25 package main\n\nimport os\n\nimport "ex.com/lib"\nimport geo\nimport util\n\nmethod main() {\n}\n
already imported: no edit
#### a group that does not exist yet
std group before the project imports: @14-14 package main\n\nimport os\n\nimport geo\n\nmethod main() {\n}\n
project group after the std imports: @23-23 package main\n\nimport os\n\nimport geo\n\nmethod main() {\n}\n
std group before several project imports: @14-14 package main\n\nimport strings\n\nimport geo\nimport util\n\nmethod main() {\n}\n
project group after several std imports: @38-38 package main\n\nimport os\nimport strings\n\nimport util\n\nmethod main() {\n}\n
#### the first import of a file
blank line below the package line: @14-14 package main\n\nimport os\n\nmethod main() {\n}\n
code right below the package line: @12-12 package main\n\nimport os\n\nmethod main() {\n}\n
the package line is the whole file: @12-12 package main\n\nimport os\n
the package line ends with a line break: @12-12 package main\n\nimport os\n\n
no package line: @0-0 import os\n\nmethod main() {\n}\n
an empty file: @0-0 import os\n\n
a project import into a file without imports: @14-14 package main\n\nimport geo\n\nmethod main() {\n}\n
two lines at once: @14-14 package main\n\nimport json\nimport thread\n\nmethod main() {\n}\n
a comment before the package line: @24-24 // header\npackage main\n\nimport os\n\nmethod main() {\n}\n
#### line endings follow the file
crlf, first import: @16-16 package main\r\n\r\nimport os\r\n\r\nmethod main() {\r\n}\r\n
crlf, code below the package line: @12-12 package main\r\n\r\nimport os\r\n\r\nmethod main() {\r\n}\r\n
crlf, into the std group: @27-27 package main\r\n\r\nimport os\r\nimport path\r\nimport strings\r\n\r\nimport geo\r\n
crlf, new project group: @25-25 package main\r\n\r\nimport os\r\n\r\nimport geo\r\n\r\nmethod main() {\r\n}\r\n
lf in a file without line breaks at all: @12-12 package main\n\nimport geo\n
#### a comment at the end of an import line
new project group after a commented import: @44-44 package main\n\nimport strings // text helpers\n\nimport zeta\n\nmethod main() {\n}\n
after the last of the group: @44-44 package main\n\nimport strings // text helpers\nimport thread\n\nmethod main() {\n}\n
before a later import: @14-14 package main\n\nimport os\nimport strings // text helpers\n\nmethod main() {\n}\n
after a block comment: @69-69 package main\n\nimport os\n\nimport geo // shapes\nimport util /* tools */\nimport zeta\n\nmethod main() {\n}\n
crlf: @38-38 package main\r\n\r\nimport strings // text\r\n\r\nimport zeta\r\n\r\nmethod main() {\r\n}\r\n
the last line without a line break: @36-36 package main\n\nimport strings // text\n\nimport zeta
